{"id":"d32f78b7dd1f3767de676d2613c175fa7dcfa62930cc134e133696120b00105a","type":"update","subject":"git.commit","source":"local-cli","body":{"sha":"3d425d04264b90e64f5879a54f71fb7f78fbeb09","parents":["f0ab162fa5a3f0b846a49785bd03063893743bd2"],"author":{"name":"Claude","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","date":"2026-10-07T14:16:31+00:00"},"committer":{"name":"Claude","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","date":"2026-10-07T14:16:31+00:00"},"message":"Build the Plan 3 launch backend and wire the dashboard to it\n\n- src/launch: manifests frozen and hashed on the integrity chain, Google\n  ID token verification, one Google account per wallet (salted sub hashes),\n  ed25519-signed commits, cancels and weighted votes, 1:1 split by SOL\n- server: /api/launch/* routes, CORS limited to the Pages origin, --host\n- CLI: \"launch create|publish|close|show\" and \"pages\"\n- index.html: commit/cancel/vote go to the backend; doctype and charset\n- README describes the project; memory.json and plans record Plan 3\n  approval, and Plan 4 (on-chain group buy) awaits approval\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019dLaQpC8ustRzQLisewKPK"},"ts":1791382591773,"block":10}
