{"id":"05f5dcee8a19f41658ebc98a5634b0475fe793836e0e3a3df191a15088d4555b","type":"update","subject":"git.commit","source":"local-cli","body":{"sha":"96b0fcff9e55309963ec95155d5a5e2806fe0a9d","parents":["3d425d04264b90e64f5879a54f71fb7f78fbeb09"],"author":{"name":"Claude","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","date":"2026-10-07T14:16:35+00:00"},"committer":{"name":"Claude","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","date":"2026-10-07T14:16:35+00:00"},"message":"Record the launch backend commit on the integrity chain\n\nAlso publishes data/dashboard.json and refreshes the chain copy in\nindex.html via \"chain pages\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019dLaQpC8ustRzQLisewKPK"},"ts":1791384600614,"block":13}
