{"id":"9e8c663b66763b908c7bc5cb17a0f49e704f82e42730d93bd3d9e3bef18f4e5b","type":"update","subject":"git.commit","source":"local-cli","body":{"sha":"5dfa44ff6e4602f9156b1993a35f17bcfbf46820","parents":["96b0fcff9e55309963ec95155d5a5e2806fe0a9d"],"author":{"name":"Claude","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","date":"2026-10-07T14:50:00+00:00"},"committer":{"name":"Claude","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","date":"2026-10-07T14:50:00+00:00"},"message":"Add the on-chain group buy (Plan 4): program, launcher, dashboard deposits\n\n- onchain/group-buy: native Solana program. Investors deposit into their\n  own escrow PDA and can withdraw until the buy; execute_buy sweeps every\n  escrow, pays the fee to the fixed buyback address and makes one pump.fun\n  buy_exact_quote_in_v2 from a vault PDA, only on a fresh curve with pinned\n  mint/buyer accounts and a slippage floor; settle hands out exact pro-rata\n  tokens and unspent SOL; refunds after cancel or deadline need no investor\n  signature. Terms are fixed at init; there is no admin key.\n- onchain/mock-pump + onchain/tests: LiteSVM end-to-end tests and golden\n  vectors that keep the JS client in sync with the Rust layout\n- onchain/client/launcher.js: init, lookup table, Jito create+buy bundle,\n  settle, refund, cancel, close; every landed tx is logged on the chain\n- src/launch/onchain.js: dependency-free PDAs and instruction encoding\n- backend: \"launch onchain\", \"launch tx\", \"buyback\" record commands;\n  dashboard shows on-chain details once init lands\n- index.html: deposit/withdraw for committed investors; [hidden] fix;\n  countdown shows Closed after close\n- plans: Plan 4 approved and implemented (escrow deposits replace\n  durable-nonce pre-signing); go-live steps in follow_up_4.md\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019dLaQpC8ustRzQLisewKPK"},"ts":1791384600793,"block":13}
